{"title":"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Last summer, Pat worked at a summer camp.<br />\nFor each day that he worked, he earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> and he was not charged for food.<br />\nFor each day that he did not work, he was not paid and he was charged <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> for food.\nAfter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> days, the money that he earned minus his food costs equalled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f8775889788b1d3b90144adaeb7dbcfbb39cb774.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" />.\nOn how many of these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> days did Pat work?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/3/5f3fb9872ef5a2eb9bcb8cf2bcafd731ae2ce528.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   60 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   68 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   50 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   57 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   34 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of days that Pat worked and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of days that he did not work. Since there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> days in total and the amount he earned overall was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f8775889788b1d3b90144adaeb7dbcfbb39cb774.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/8/098bbcc6561f71bf574fb240a05bd398fd553e14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w + n = 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b7990cc80c6e03ada3929c9f97f09967ae85053.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20(w + n) = 70 \\times 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"164\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/3/c53db79b6f70920450beb7e9a41ae29de9f3b5c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20w + 20n = 1400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/43402ecf6e5dc7b23d3228cd8a519e163b19d2b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100w - 20n = 5440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"155\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/3/c53db79b6f70920450beb7e9a41ae29de9f3b5c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20w + 20n = 1400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/43402ecf6e5dc7b23d3228cd8a519e163b19d2b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100w - 20n = 5440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"155\" height=\"15\" /> together, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/3742ff59340863547a0689966d4fe4258a99adf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20w + 20n + 100w - 20n = 1400 + 5440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"318\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/1/7618d8177bcea15ac4e6e5bddd2f6ebfe23881fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120w = 6840$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e1243a75a2ba53ce458c0b6f14ea35f8f2e5d8ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w = \\frac{6840}{120} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 57}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"170\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of days that Pat worked. Since there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> days in total, he did not work on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7a3bd66e999f6fcfdbc3bef7bece7de2d6bfb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70 - w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" /> days. He earned <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/e/83ea7282e4c091ae06aa61287832afdc3485fe98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> overall, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b46e0f3cda921eda7da2caefd4cc932cc0951b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100w - 20(70 - w) = 5440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"212\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f030df11ba6b741a448ff58438d34100be637b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100w - 20 \\times 70 - 20 \\times -w = 5440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"274\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d360f86f3f65fedcd59dd792128b3c6c3d226a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120w - 1400 = 5440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"162\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/2060ce4c4114e1850ec8fc2e1e70428dd8d1116b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120w = 5440 + 1400 = 6840$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"222\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e1243a75a2ba53ce458c0b6f14ea35f8f2e5d8ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w = \\frac{6840}{120} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 57}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"170\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat\">2