•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"CEMC Fermat\">CEMC Fermat</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017234344\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 211/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2054/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 314/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5306/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.904      1 Template:CEMC_box\n100.00%    7.904      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36387:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017234344 and revision id 281565. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}